#: archaeology_bridge.py:24
msgid "Scripture in Stone"
msgstr "La Escritura en piedra"

#: archaeology_bridge.py:224
msgid ""
"Artifacts of the biblical world — inscriptions, monuments, and objects that "
"touch the people, places, and events named in Scripture, in historical "
"sequence."
msgstr ""
"Objetos del mundo bíblico: inscripciones, monumentos y piezas que tocan a "
"las personas, los lugares y los hechos que nombra la Escritura, en orden "
"histórico."

#: archaeology_bridge.py:227
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{n} artifacts"
msgstr "{n} objetos"

#: archaeology_bridge.py:228
msgid "Public-domain objects; photographs CC BY-SA (per-item credit)"
msgstr "Objetos en dominio público; fotografías CC BY-SA (crédito por pieza)"

#: archaeology_bridge.py:229
msgid ""
"A curated, measured gallery: each artifact links to the passage it attests. "
"Forgeries and disputed objects are excluded; genuine scholarly doubt is "
"noted."
msgstr ""
"Una galería seleccionada y comedida: cada objeto enlaza con el pasaje que "
"atestigua. Se excluyen las falsificaciones y las piezas discutidas; la duda "
"académica legítima se hace constar."

